  "limits": [
    "NEEB here is grain revenue minus listed material inputs only; no land rent, complete machinery service/capital costs, labor or straw-sale opportunity value",
    "Published ANOVA: yield and NEEB differences not significant; do not equate absence of significance with proven equivalence",
    "2020 NT Table 5 revenue minus total cost is 2221, but Table 6 NEEB is 2211 USD/ha; cannot silently correct original values",
    "Table 5 rounded component costs differ from rounded totals by 1 USD/ha, consistent with independent rounding",
    "Herbicide quantity is kg in Table 2 but Table 1 environmental coefficients use L; do not silently assume density=1",
    "Formula 2 excludes SOC stock change and seasonal soil respiration CO2; not full ecosystem carbon balance",
    "Growing-season sampling excludes off-season fluxes; no verified carbon credits",
    "No measured soil-carbon stock increment or MWD in main paper; do not borrow another site's SOC rate or compute the soil index with imputed MWD",
    "Costs use two-year mean inputs and source FX 6.4, not current FX; period is eight/nine years after establishment, not transition costs",
    "Supplement S1/S2 retrieved from publisher on 2026-11-09: 2020 soil concentrations and machinery specifications only; no bulk density, SOC stock trajectory, MWD or full machinery costs."
  ],
  "supplement_limits": [
    "S1为2020年0–20 cm土壤有机碳及全氮、全磷、全钾浓度；不等于碳储量或逐年增汇。",
    "SOC显著性字母：CT为b，MP和NT均为a；NT与MP未检出显著差异。",
    "NT与CT差异同时包含免耕和秸秆归还差异，不能单独归因于免耕。",
    "附件未提供容重、团聚体MWD、完整经营成本或原始重复小区观测；不能据此填补综合指数或碳汇核算缺项。",
    "附件自身未定义±数值为SD还是SE，保留原文，不自行判定。",
    "S2为设备参数，不是作业服务收费；原文喷雾机宽度120 cm照录，未擅自改为1200。"
  ],
  "subsidy_rule": "Let U = omitted incremental cost + lost net straw value + supported transition risk - realized carbon net cash - existing actual subsidy benefit. Incremental compensation = max(0, U - listed material margin gain). U is signed and unobserved; no default of zero. This is an accounting threshold, not an optimal subsidy estimate."
}